## Banners (Connected)

autostart-off = Start at login is off. CodexBar won't be running after you next log in, and this applet will be empty.
turn-on = Turn on
tray-prompt = CodexBar's tray icon shows the same usage as this applet.
hide-tray = Hide tray icon
keep-tray = Keep it
request-refused = CodexBar refused the change.
request-failed = CodexBar didn't make the change. Try again.
